<title>USA: Grafton, Wis. won by John Kinnard.</title>
<headline>Grafton, Wis. won by John Kinnard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Kinnard said it won $1.850 million of Grafton, Wis., general obligation capital improvement bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
</text>
